  "photo": [],
  "video": "wensolution.mp4",
  "heading": "<h2>Subscription-based<span style=\"color: rgb(245, 95, 66);\">&nbsp;web solutions</span></h2>",
  "subheading": "",
  "description": "<p>Our subscription model offers a sustainable solution for businesses to regularly update design assets and meet market expectations. Our approach maximizes design efficiency and reliability, blending high-quality creativity with productivity in a tech-driven era.</p>",
  "questions": [
    {
      "question": "<p>Fast &amp; consistent delivery</p>",
      "answer": "<p>Our collaborative platform<strong>&nbsp;streamlines project management</strong>, making it&nbsp;<strong>highly efficient.</strong>&nbsp;You have the&nbsp;<strong>flexibility</strong>&nbsp;to add multiple design requests to your board. Our designers will deliver them&nbsp;<strong>one-by-one</strong>.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>You can&nbsp;<strong>easily track</strong>&nbsp;the progress,&nbsp;<strong>provide feedback</strong>, and include any additional information that will assist the designer. Depending on the complexity,&nbsp;<strong>designs</strong>&nbsp;will be delivered&nbsp;<strong>within 1-3 days</strong>, ensuring the timely completion of your projects.</p>"
    },
    {
      "question": "<p>Cost-effective</p>",
      "answer": "<p>Hiring a team of designers, developers, and social media&nbsp;<strong>experts</strong>&nbsp;<strong>can be expensive.</strong>&nbsp;Additionally, it can be&nbsp;<strong>challenging</strong>&nbsp;to find&nbsp;<strong>reliable</strong>&nbsp;experts. With our subscription plans, you can get&nbsp;<strong>access to all these services</strong>&nbsp;at a&nbsp;<strong>fraction of the cost</strong>&nbsp;of hiring your own team.</p>"
    },
    {
      "question": "<p>Flexible subscriptions</p>",
      "answer": "<p>We offer flexible subscriptions which means you can cancel or pause your subscription every month. If you find your business with a&nbsp;<strong>lighter workload</strong>, you have the option to temporarily&nbsp;<strong>pause your subscription.</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>You can&nbsp;<strong>reactivate</strong>&nbsp;it at any time and utilize the remaining duration of your subscription.&nbsp;These options are&nbsp;<strong>easily accessible</strong>&nbsp;within your&nbsp;<strong>account settings.</strong></p>"
    },
    {
      "question": "<p>High-quality custom work</p>",
      "answer": "<p>In today's market, regularly refreshing and updating creative assets and websites is essential to&nbsp;<strong>maintain a competitive edge.</strong>&nbsp;Our custom designs are specifically crafted to make you stand out from the crowd.</p><p>Not only do we create visually appealing designs, but we also&nbsp;<strong>implement business incentives,</strong>&nbsp;such as lead generation strategies, to optimize your assets. With our services, you'll have&nbsp;<strong>easy access to a pool of top-notch designers,</strong>&nbsp;right at your fingertips</p>"
    }
  ],
