  "heading": "<p class=\"ql-align-center\">Challenges<span style=\"color: rgb(245, 95, 66);\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(243, 202, 13);\">businesses face</span></p>",
  "subheading": "",
  "description": "<p>no</p>",
  "questions": [
    {
      "question": "<p>Time constrains</p>",
      "answer": "<p>Managing design and digital assets can be time-consuming, diverting resources from core activities. Working with multiple freelancers or agencies for design and digital management can worsen time constraints, leading to communication issues and project delays</p>"
    },
    {
      "question": "<p>Financial constraints for long-term agency commitment</p>",
      "answer": "<p>Businesses often face financial challenges that prevent them from committing to long-term partnerships with design agencies. While recognizing the value of external design support, they may find it difficult to sustain financial commitments over an extended period.</p>"
    },
    {
      "question": "<p>Difficulty finding good design talent</p>",
      "answer": "<p>Businesses face challenges in finding and retaining skilled design talent. The shortage of qualified designers may hinder their ability to fulfill design needs effectively</p>"
    },
    {
      "question": "<p>Limited resources to meet design demand</p>",
      "answer": "<p>Limited resources, including budget, time, and personnel, may hinder businesses' ability to effectively manage design and digital assets in-house or through various channels</p>"
    }
  ],
